/treating/Red Alerts

- /Code/1_adding_coordinates_to_localities_and_demographics.R: Adds geographic coordinates to each Israeli locality, as well as demographic variables.

- /Code/2_preparing_for_regressions.R: transforms datasets to facilitate regressions.

- /Code/3_main_regressions.R: performs difference-in-difference regressions.

- /Code/4_plotting_graphs.R: plots vote-evolution graphs to check for parallel trends.

- /Code/5_logit_regression.R: performs the Logit analysis to check whether being treated (by a Red Alert) affects the probability of being treated in the future.

- /Code/6_maps.R: plots maps.

